但共观火，不复视围。孚出北门，遂从西北角突围得去","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":570,"end":637,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-19525e01c7a44ab9fb39","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"孚事讫，欲得还，而顾外围必急，不可复冒。谓己使命当速反，乃阴心计，请配曰：‘今城中谷少，无用老弱为也；不如驱出之以省谷也。’配从其计，乃复夜简别得数千人，皆使持白幡，从三门并出降","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":480,"end":569,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-44f3b0417da045c5c319","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"孚比见尚，尚甚欢喜","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":662,"end":671,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-90a2719401ac7fe0a8a8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"其明，太祖闻孚已得出，抵掌笑曰：‘果如吾言也","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":638,"end":660,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
